CHF as long as the corresponding euro equivalent is not exceeded.The shareholders shall be granted a right to subscribe for the bonds in principle.However, the Executive Board is authorized, subject to consent of the Supervisory Board, to exclude the subscription rights of shareholders in the following instances:
(1) insofar as the issue price of a bond is not significantly lower than the theoretical market value calculated according to recognized methods of financial mathematics; 
(2) to the extent that this is necessary for fractional amounts resulting from the subscription ratio;

